  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"note\"><i><b>Note:</b> This page needs some cleanup in the list of fish. The mobile/tablet page numbers need fixing.</i></div>\n<p>.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/17/Purple_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225936\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Purple lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Purple lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"240\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Purple lure</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 27</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  45 mins</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lure Workbench\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>&#160;?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">38 mins</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Purple lures</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 27. They are used to lure <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a>.\n</p><p>They are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tackle box</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making purple lures</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0a/Lure_Workbench.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925185602\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lure Workbench\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Lure Workbench</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Purple lures are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench</a>.\n</p><p>To make a purple lure, players need the following ingredient, in the specified quantity:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/66/Purple_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312141325\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Purple Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Purple Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 45 minutes to make one lure, and 38 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> machine. Each lure gives players 4 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using purple lures</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"note\"><i><b>Note:</b> T=Tablet, MB=Mobile followed by the page number.</i></div>\n<p>Purple lures can fish the following <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a>:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/coho-salmon-10639\" title=\"Coho Salmon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coho Salmon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/rainbowfish-10863\" title=\"Rainbowfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rainbowfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/bluespotted-sunfish-10864\" title=\"Bluespotted Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bluespotted Sunfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/bitterling-10865\" title=\"Bitterling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bitterling\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/coho-salmon-10639\" title=\"Coho Salmon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coho Salmon</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/rainbowfish-10863\" title=\"Rainbowfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rainbowfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bluespotted-sunfish-10864\" title=\"Bluespotted Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bluespotted Sunfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bitterling-10865\" title=\"Bitterling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bitterling</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T#4 - MB#6\n</td>\n<td>T#4 - MB#7\n</td>\n<td>T#5 - B#8\n</td>\n<td>T#6 - B#10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/shadow-bass-10032\" title=\"Shadow Bass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shadow Bass\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/spotted-sunfish-11438\" title=\"Spotted Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Spotted Sunfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/sauger-11442\" title=\"Sauger\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sauger\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/arctic-charr-11443\" title=\"Arctic Charr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Arctic Charr\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/shadow-bass-10032\" title=\"Shadow Bass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shadow Bass</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/spotted-sunfish-11438\" title=\"Spotted Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spotted Sunfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/sauger-11442\" title=\"Sauger\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sauger</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/arctic-charr-11443\" title=\"Arctic Charr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Arctic Charr</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T#9 - MB#17\n</td>\n<td>T#10 - MB#19\n</td>\n<td>T#12 - MB#22\n</td>\n<td>T#14 - MB#26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/greater-redhorse-11435\" title=\"Greater Redhorse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Greater Redhorse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/grass-carp-11446\" title=\"Grass Carp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Grass Carp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/longear-sunfish-11451\" title=\"Longear Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Longear Sunfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/giant-barb-11060\" title=\"Giant Barb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Giant Barb\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/greater-redhorse-11435\" title=\"Greater Redhorse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Greater Redhorse</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/grass-carp-11446\" title=\"Grass Carp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Grass Carp</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/longear-sunfish-11451\" title=\"Longear Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Longear Sunfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/giant-barb-11060\" title=\"Giant Barb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Giant Barb</a></b>\n<p><span>★★★</span><br>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T#15 - MB#29\n</td>\n<td>T#16 - MB#30\n</td>\n<td>T#17 - MB#33\n</td>\n<td>T#18 - MB#34\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/lake-sturgeon-11059\" title=\"Lake Sturgeon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lake Sturgeon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/nile-perch-11452\" title=\"Nile Perch\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Nile Perch\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/white-catfish-11454\" title=\"White Catfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"White Catfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/quillback-17181\" title=\"Quillback\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Quillback\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/lake-sturgeon-11059\" title=\"Lake Sturgeon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lake Sturgeon</a></b>\n<p><span>★★★</span><br>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/nile-perch-11452\" title=\"Nile Perch\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nile Perch</a></b>\n<p><span>★★★</span><br>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/white-catfish-11454\" title=\"White Catfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">White Catfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/quillback-17181\" title=\"Quillback\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Quillback</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T#19 - MB#36\n</td>\n<td>T#20 - MB#38\n</td>\n<td>T#22 - MB#42\n</td>\n<td>T#22 - MB#43\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Lures cannot be bought or sold in the roadside shop, but can be traded between <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighbors</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boats</a> never ask for lures.<b>Trivia</b></li>\n<li>Using a glitch related to having multiple farms, it is actually possible to get purple lures before level 27 using Neighborhood Requests. By playing on a farm that is Level 27 or higher, select the Tackle Box tab on the Neighborhood Requests screen. Then, switch to a farm between levels 12 and 26, and open Neighborhood Requests, and you will be on the (invisible) Tackle Box tab, where you can then request purple lures.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-lure-workbench-products-29469\" title=\"Category:Lure Workbench Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/blue-lure-30470\" title=\"Blue Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gold-lure-33410\" title=\"Gold Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gold Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/green-lure-30469\" title=\"Green Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/purple-lure-33409\" title=\"Purple Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Purple Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/red-lure-30467\" title=\"Red Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Red Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030527\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.115 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.162 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 791/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4140/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 851/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 76/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 771766/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   78.596      1 -total\n 72.70%   57.136      1 Template:Infobox\n 33.06%   25.985      4 Template:Infoicon\n 16.44%   12.922      1 Template:Navigation\n  9.85%    7.740      1 Template:LureWorkbenchMenu\n  3.18%    2.501      1 Template:Languages\n  3.17%    2.488      2 Template:Note\n  1.89%    1.488      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  1.76%    1.380      2 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:33409-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901030527 and revision id 108064. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
